const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"从组合选择走向价格均衡",en:"From portfolio choice to equilibrium prices"},body:{zh:"Sharpe关心分散投资之后，哪种风险仍会进入资产价格。把单个资产看起来很波动，直接等同于它应获得更高收益，会忽略其与组合其他资产的共同变化。这也是理解理论为何从组合出发，而不是从单只股票排名出发的关键。",en:"Sharpe asks which risk remains priced after diversification. Standalone volatility misses an asset's interaction with the rest of a portfolio, motivating an equilibrium rather than a stock-ranking argument."},reference:{url:"https://cdn.uw.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/103/2022/07/12172209/Sharpe-1964-Capital-Asset-Prices-seminal-article.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：1964年期刊版，第425–426页",en:"Source: 1964 journal article, pp. 425–426"}}},{title:{zh:"相关性改变组合机会",en:"Correlation changes portfolio opportunities"},body:{zh:"组合风险不仅取决于各项资产自身波动，也取决于它们如何一起变化。两个波动相近的资产，放入同一组合后的贡献可能不同。判断资产作用时需要整个协方差结构，不能只根据每只资产的单独风险大小进行排序。",en:"Portfolio opportunities depend on co-movement as well as individual volatility. Similar standalone risks can make different contributions to a combination; isolated risk rankings lose that distinction."},reference:{url:"https://cdn.uw.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/103/2022/07/12172209/Sharpe-1964-Capital-Asset-Prices-seminal-article.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：1964年期刊版，第431–432页",en:"Source: 1964 journal article, pp. 431–432"}}},{title:{zh:"共同预期是一项强假设",en:"Shared expectations are a strong assumption"},body:{zh:"均衡推导假设投资者对预期收益、波动和相关性具有共同判断，并能按相同条件借贷。作者承认这些假设很强。现实中的观点分歧、融资成本和约束不因此消失；应用模型时，应把这些差异看作待检验的边界。",en:"Investors share forecasts and borrowing terms in the equilibrium construction. These restrictive assumptions do not erase real disagreements or financing constraints; application needs to confront those differences."},reference:{url:"https://cdn.uw.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/103/2022/07/12172209/Sharpe-1964-Capital-Asset-Prices-seminal-article.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：1964年期刊版，第433–434页",en:"Source: 1964 journal article, pp. 433–434"}}},{title:{zh:"风险组合与风险承担程度分开",en:"Separate the risky combination from risk tolerance"},body:{zh:"在给定条件下，选择风险资产组合与决定借入或贷出多少资金可以分开考虑。共同组合不意味着所有投资者承担相同风险，其与无风险资产的配置仍会不同。若借贷条件改变，这种分离的适用性也要重新分析。",en:"Under the stated conditions, choosing the risky combination separates from borrowing or lending. Sharing that combination does not mean investors choose identical overall risk exposure."},reference:{url:"https://cdn.uw.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/103/2022/07/12172209/Sharpe-1964-Capital-Asset-Prices-seminal-article.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：1964年期刊版，第433页",en:"Source: 1964 journal article, pp. 433"}}},{title:{zh:"系统风险与总风险不同",en:"Systematic exposure differs from total risk"},body:{zh:"论文将资产对有效组合收益变化的敏感度与不能通过加入该组合消除的风险联系起来。这种敏感度不是资产的全部波动，也不是相关系数本身。模型讨论预期收益与这种暴露的关系，不能直接把资本市场线用于每个未分散资产。",en:"Sensitivity to an efficient combination identifies systematic exposure, distinct from total volatility or correlation alone. The capital-market relation for efficient portfolios is not a standalone-volatility rule for every asset."},reference:{url:"https://cdn.uw.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/103/2022/07/12172209/Sharpe-1964-Capital-Asset-Prices-seminal-article.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：1964年期刊版，第436, 439–440页",en:"Source: 1964 journal article, pp. 436, 439–440"}}},{title:{zh:"事前关系不等于事后每期兑现",en:"An expected relation is not a realized guarantee"},body:{zh:"理论中的预期收益与风险暴露属于事前判断，而实际样本回报会受意外变化影响。历史回归可以帮助提出检验问题，却不是理论自动兑现的证明。选择哪个市场代理以及用什么窗口估计，都需要另行说明，不能从模型名称直接得到答案。",en:"The relation concerns expectations, not guaranteed realized returns. Historical estimates need explicit market proxies and windows; a model's name cannot supply those empirical choices or validate their results."},reference:{url:"https://cdn.uw.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/103/2022/07/12172209/Sharpe-1964-Capital-Asset-Prices-seminal-article.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：1964年期刊版，第439–440页",en:"Source: 1964 journal article, pp. 439–440"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"这是带有共同预期、借贷条件等假设的均衡模型，不是历史拟合结果或收益预测保证。市场代理、估计窗口与实际融资约束仍需单独检验。",en:"This equilibrium model relies on shared expectations and borrowing assumptions. It is not empirical validation or a return guarantee; market proxies and actual financing constraints require separate scrutiny."}};export{e as default};
